{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main0950_president_01",
      "hash": "43e9080775e6fb2f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "社長「哦哦，這位少年！\\n多虧了你，我才能得救啊！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main0950_president_02",
      "hash": "43e9090775e6fce2",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "社長「哦哦，這位少女！\\n多虧了妳，我才能得救啊！"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main0950_partner_a_01",
      "hash": "c9f6ab0c5f166b39",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "皮卡皮卡！"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main0950_partner_b_01",
      "hash": "1c046af0a3c5ef46",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "布伊布伊！"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main0950_president_08",
      "hash": "43e90f0775e70714",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……啊哈哈！看來不只是[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳，\\n該說你們才對！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main0950_president_05",
      "hash": "43e9040775e6f463",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我會永遠記得，\\n在最危急的時刻，\\r\\n是你們勇敢地幫助了我！"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main0950_president_06",
      "hash": "43e9050775e6f616",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "哦！對了！\\n我得準備謝禮給[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳才行！\\c\\n我是個大方的人，\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳想要什麼都可以。\\c\\n譬如說這個，\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳覺得如何啊？"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main0950_sys_01",
      "hash": "f506055ea4260db4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]從社長那裡\\n得到了[VAR COLOR(0006)]大師球[VAR COLOR(0000)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main0950_president_03",
      "hash": "43e90a0775e6fe95",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "社長「這是大師球！\\n它是我們秘密研發中的樣品，\\r\\n到哪裡都買不到喔！"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_main0950_president_07",
      "hash": "43e9060775e6f7c9",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "只要把它投擲出去，\\n就一定能捉到寶可夢！\\c\\n……其實我們也就\\n只製造出這一個而已喔。"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_main0950_president_09",
      "hash": "43e9100775e708c7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳就偷偷地……\\n偷偷地用用看吧。"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_main0950_president_04",
      "hash": "43e9030775e6f2b0",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "社長「噢～！\\n解救了公司危機的恩人！\\r\\n之前真是謝謝[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_main0950_president_10",
      "hash": "43ec8d0775ea1305",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "社長「噢～！\\n請[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳等一等！\\r\\n讓我報答[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_workerm1_01_p04_cave_d1011",
      "hash": "d2eb872ba95fcdcc",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 13]"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "msg_main0950_stafff_01",
      "hash": "079f21ac444df12d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "秘書「這次承蒙您的幫助，\\n真的非常謝謝您！\\c\\n我們社長和全體員工\\n都要對您致上最深的感謝！"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "id": "msg_main0950_stafff_02",
      "hash": "079f1eac444dec14",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "秘書「一定能夠\\n捉到寶可夢的精靈球……\\c\\n如果不是實力頂尖的訓練家，\\n是沒有資格擁有它的。\\c\\n社長正是因為看中了您的實力，\\n才把大師球送給您的。"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_main_event_0950_max",
      "hash": "149c479c26cfcd99"
    }
  ]
}
